== ui_card "Card Helper"
  p The <code>ui_card</code> helper creates a contained box for content.
  
  h4 Usage
  pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px;"
    code
      | == ui_card "Title" do
          p Content goes here...
    
  h4 Example
  == ui_card "Example Card"
    p This is a card body.
    == ui_button "Action", :primary
